msgstr "上游傳回了 HTTP %(status)s。這不是 Demo 頁面不存在，也不表示上游請求成功。"

#: templates/pages/examples/http/_result.html:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The upstream operation timed out within the %(seconds)s-second budget. No"
" retry was made."
msgstr "上游操作在 %(seconds)s 秒的等待限制內逾時，未進行重試。"

